  "@type": "schema:Dataset",
  "schema:name": "Genome API JSON-LD context",
  "schema:description": "A JSON-LD @context for the objects Genome's own API contract declares: one class per component schema, one property per declared field, typed from the contract. Derived by script (derive-json-ld.py, 2026-10-12) from openapi/genome-host-to-host-api-openapi.yml, openapi/genome-payouts-api-openapi.yml.",
